telemetry
------------------------------------------
Telemetry is a C++ library for exposing application metrics, counters and state
as a tree of virtual directories and files, with aggregation of values. The
FUSE-based AppFs filesystem interface is not built.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libtelemetry-devel-1.4.0-1bl1
  libtelemetry1-1.4.0-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/CESNET/telemetry

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/CESNET/telemetry/archive/refs/tags/v1.4.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack telemetry-1.4.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./telemetry-1.4.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/telemetry-1.4.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/telemetry-1.4.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libtelemetry1-1.4.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libtelemetry-devel-1.4.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

